          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most decks, buy the Chapin 25012 pump sprayer, fit the fan nozzle, use the spray shield near the house, and brush everything behind it. Step up to the 2-gallon Chapin 26021XP for a big deck or a fence, especially with oil-based stain.
          </p>
